lemma coralVecFe {V:Type}[Fintype V][DecidableEq V](x:V→ℂ): ∑ i:V,x i • (Pi.single i 1: V→ℂ)=x:=by funext i; rw[Finset.sum_apply]; simp [Pi.single_apply]
lemma NearIsoFe {V:Type}[Fintype V][DecidableEq V](P:ℕ → (V→ℂ)→ₗ[ℂ] (V→ℂ))(h:∀ v:V→ℂ,Tendsto (fun f=> P f v) atTop (𝓝 v)):∀ᶠ f in atTop, Function.Bijective (P f):=by
 let W:=Module.End ℂ (V→ℂ); let D: ℕ→ W:=fun f=> P f-LinearMap.id
 let t(i:V): V→ℂ:=Pi.single i 1
 let Gs (f:ℕ):=∑ i:V, ‖D f (t i)‖
 have he:Tendsto Gs atTop (𝓝 0):=by
    have hu(i:V): Tendsto (fun f=> D f (t i)) atTop (𝓝 0):=by
      suffices hv:Tendsto (fun f=> P f (t i)- (t i)) atTop (𝓝 0) by apply hv.congr; intro k; unfold D; rw[LinearMap.sub_apply,LinearMap.id_apply]
      simpa only [sub_self] using (h (t i)).sub (tendsto_const_nhds (x:= t i))
    simpa only[norm_zero,sum_const_zero] using (tendsto_finsetSum Finset.univ (fun i _=> (hu i).norm))
 filter_upwards [he.eventually (gt_mem_nhds (zero_lt_one))] with f z
 suffices e:Injective (P f) from ⟨e, LinearMap.injective_iff_surjective.mp e⟩
 apply LinearMap.ker_eq_bot.mp; apply LinearMap.ker_eq_bot'.mpr; intro v T
 by_contra w; have hp:0 < ‖v‖:=norm_pos_iff.mpr w
 have hv:‖D f v‖ ≤ ‖v‖ * Gs f:=by
    nth_rw 1 [←coralVecFe v]; rw[map_sum]; unfold Gs; rw[mul_sum]; refine (norm_sum_le ..).trans (sum_le_sum (fun i _=>?_)); rw[(D f).map_smul]; exact (norm_smul_le ..).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (norm_le_pi_norm v i) (norm_nonneg _))
 unfold D at hv; rw [LinearMap.sub_apply,T,LinearMap.id_apply,zero_sub,norm_neg] at hv; exact hv.not_gt (lt_of_lt_of_le (mul_lt_mul_of_pos_left z hp) (le_of_eq (mul_one _))) -- z definal
-- expansion correction select with Artbudget. Can use later composition.
